spec AudioSleep.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK NoUnsafeCommit TimeoutSafe
check PROPERTIES EventualReturn TimeoutRecovery CommitParks
reach Acknowledged | normal
reach TimedOut | normal
reach Committed | normal
reach DelayedWorker | delayed
reach FailureAfterRead | fail-during
reach KnownFailure | already-failed
reach TimeoutAckRace | normal
run normal attempts=1 | Attempts=1 WorkerMode=0 Disabled=FALSE
run normal attempts=2 | Attempts=2 WorkerMode=0 Disabled=FALSE
run delayed attempts=2 | Attempts=2 WorkerMode=1 Disabled=FALSE
run already-failed | Attempts=1 WorkerMode=2 Disabled=FALSE
run fail-during attempts=2 | Attempts=2 WorkerMode=3 Disabled=FALSE
run disabled | Attempts=1 WorkerMode=0 Disabled=TRUE
